 ],
 "timeline": [
  {
   "turn_index": 0,
   "speaker": "Valerie",
   "text": "Thanks for coming, everyone. Dwayne, start us off with where we are?",
   "start_s": 0.5,
   "end_s": 5.0
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 1,
   "speaker": "Dwayne",
   "text": "Balance is eighteen thousand four hundred. Annual income was thirty-six nine.",
   "start_s": 6.156,
   "end_s": 10.87
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 2,
   "speaker": "Phil",
   "text": "Hold on. I was told we're sitting on thirty grand. Where's the rest?",
   "start_s": 12.018,
   "end_s": 16.351
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 3,
   "speaker": "Dwayne",
   "text": "There is no rest. It was never thirty.",
   "start_s": 16.608,
   "end_s": 20.036
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 4,
   "speaker": "Phil",
   "text": "My neighbor said thirty.",
   "start_s": 20.321,
   "end_s": 21.654
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 5,
   "speaker": "Valerie",
   "text": "Your neighbor is not the treasurer, Phil.",
   "start_s": 22.689,
   "end_s": 25.314
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 6,
   "speaker": "Dwayne",
   "text": "Eighteen four. I can send you every statement if you want them.",
   "start_s": 26.25,
   "end_s": 31.393
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 7,
   "speaker": "Phil",
   "text": "Yeah, I want them.",
   "start_s": 32.263,
   "end_s": 33.596
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 8,
   "speaker": "Dwayne",
   "text": "Fine. You'll have them tonight.",
   "start_s": 34.104,
   "end_s": 36.247
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 9,
   "speaker": "Sienna",
   "text": "How many families are members now?",
   "start_s": 37.053,
   "end_s": 39.11
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 10,
   "speaker": "Valerie",
   "text": "Two hundred and five, out of about eleven hundred students.",
   "start_s": 39.917,
   "end_s": 43.667
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 11,
   "speaker": "Phil",
   "text": "Two hundred families paying for eleven hundred kids. That's the real problem.",
   "start_s": 44.448,
   "end_s": 48.448
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 12,
   "speaker": "Valerie",
   "text": "The prom. The class officers asked for six thousand to bring the ticket price down.",
   "start_s": 48.806,
   "end_s": 54.431
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 13,
   "speaker": "Sienna",
   "text": "Tickets are a hundred dollars right now. That's a lot for some families.",
   "start_s": 55.062,
   "end_s": 59.519
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 14,
   "speaker": "Phil",
   "text": "Then give them the six grand. Easy.",
   "start_s": 60.113,
   "end_s": 62.446
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 15,
   "speaker": "Dwayne",
   "text": "Prom costs twenty-four thousand total. The subsidy is a quarter of it.",
   "start_s": 63.369,
   "end_s": 68.512
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 16,
   "speaker": "Valerie",
   "text": "We have about four hundred seniors, so six thousand is fifteen dollars each.",
   "start_s": 69.707,
   "end_s": 74.582
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 17,
   "speaker": "Dwayne",
   "text": "That's a lot of money for one night.",
   "start_s": 75.731,
   "end_s": 79.16
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 18,
   "speaker": "Sienna",
   "text": "It's the one night some of them will remember.",
   "start_s": 79.904,
   "end_s": 82.99
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 19,
   "speaker": "Phil",
   "text": "The Tigers might make the state semifinal, did you see? First time in twenty years.",
   "start_s": 83.635,
   "end_s": 88.635
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 20,
   "speaker": "Dwayne",
   "text": "They lost to Eastfield last week.",
   "start_s": 89.103,
   "end_s": 91.675
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 21,
   "speaker": "Phil",
   "text": "Eastfield cheats. Everyone knows it.",
   "start_s": 91.911,
   "end_s": 93.578
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 22,
   "speaker": "Sienna",
   "text": "Can we please stay on prom?",
   "start_s": 93.805,
   "end_s": 95.863
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 23,
   "speaker": "Dwayne",
   "text": "What about a sliding scale instead? Free for kids on lunch assistance, full price for everyone else.",
   "start_s": 96.528,
   "end_s": 103.814
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 24,
   "speaker": "Valerie",
   "text": "That's harder to run, but it's fairer.",
   "start_s": 104.332,
   "end_s": 106.957
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 25,
   "speaker": "Sienna",
   "text": "Wait, I just checked the student portal. Tickets are eighty-five, not a hundred. I had last year's price.",
   "start_s": 107.537,
   "end_s": 113.708
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 26,
   "speaker": "Phil",
   "text": "Eighty-five, a hundred, kids still can't afford it.",
   "start_s": 114.8,
   "end_s": 117.466
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 27,
   "speaker": "Valerie",
   "text": "Okay. Three thousand for a sliding scale, aimed at students on lunch assistance. That's what we'll propose.",
   "start_s": 118.192,
   "end_s": 124.567
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 28,
   "speaker": "Sienna",
   "text": "The wellness program. Seventy-two hundred for a part-time counselor and the peer support training.",
   "start_s": 125.328,
   "end_s": 130.128
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 29,
   "speaker": "Phil",
   "text": "Isn't that the school district's job?",
   "start_s": 130.564,
   "end_s": 132.564
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 30,
   "speaker": "Sienna",
   "text": "It should be. But each counselor has like six hundred kids.",
   "start_s": 132.788,
   "end_s": 136.559
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 31,
   "speaker": "Dwayne",
   "text": "The district number is three eighty per counselor. Still too many, but not six hundred.",
   "start_s": 137.084,
   "end_s": 143.513
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 32,
   "speaker": "Sienna",
   "text": "Three eighty. Okay. It's still a waitlist of weeks.",
   "start_s": 143.85,
   "end_s": 146.935
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 33,
   "speaker": "Phil",
   "text": "Seventy-two hundred and we can't even do grad night?",
   "start_s": 147.645,
   "end_s": 150.645
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 34,
   "speaker": "Dwayne",
   "text": "Grad night is ninety-five hundred. We've never covered all of it.",
   "start_s": 151.844,
   "end_s": 156.558
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 35,
   "speaker": "Valerie",
   "text": "Here's what I'm hearing. Wellness matters more than one party.",
   "start_s": 157.432,
   "end_s": 161.182
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 36,
   "speaker": "Phil",
   "text": "Says the woman whose kid wants a cheap prom.",
   "start_s": 161.564,
   "end_s": 164.564
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 37,
   "speaker": "Valerie",
   "text": "That's not fair, Phil.",
   "start_s": 165.658,
   "end_s": 167.158
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 38,
   "speaker": "Dwayne",
   "text": "It's not. Let's keep it about the budget.",
   "start_s": 168.155,
   "end_s": 171.583
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 39,
   "speaker": "Sienna",
   "text": "Could the program start with just the peer support training this year? It's cheaper.",
   "start_s": 172.517,
   "end_s": 177.317
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 40,
   "speaker": "Dwayne",
   "text": "That part is about two thousand. The counselor is the expensive part.",
   "start_s": 178.424,
   "end_s": 183.566
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 41,
   "speaker": "Sienna",
   "text": "Then the full program. It's seventy-two hundred and it's worth it.",
   "start_s": 184.529,
   "end_s": 188.3
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 42,
   "speaker": "Valerie",
   "text": "We fund the wellness program in full, and grad night gets what's left after that.",
   "start_s": 189.29,
   "end_s": 194.915
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 43,
   "speaker": "Phil",
   "text": "Grad night gets nothing, then.",
   "start_s": 195.469,
   "end_s": 197.135
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 44,
   "speaker": "Dwayne",
   "text": "Not nothing. Less.",
   "start_s": 198.316,
   "end_s": 199.602
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 45,
   "speaker": "Valerie",
   "text": "The vote is on February twelfth.",
   "start_s": 200.764,
   "end_s": 203.014
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 46,
   "speaker": "Dwayne",
   "text": "I'll put together the proposed budget and send it to the board by Monday.",
   "start_s": 203.375,
   "end_s": 209.375
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 47,
   "speaker": "Phil",
   "text": "Can parents propose changes at the meeting?",
   "start_s": 210.329,
   "end_s": 212.662
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 48,
   "speaker": "Valerie",
   "text": "Amendments are allowed, if they're seconded.",
   "start_s": 213.577,
   "end_s": 215.827
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 49,
   "speaker": "Phil",
   "text": "Then I'll be proposing one.",
   "start_s": 216.488,
   "end_s": 218.155
  },
